flowchart TB
    A[closeCommitId] --> B[allocationId]
    A --> C[settlementIntentId]
    C --> D[Compute settlementEffectId]
    D --> E[Idempotency Check]
    E --> F{Already Committed?}
    F -- Yes --> G[NO_OP Receipt]
    F -- No --> H[Execute Payment/Escrow]
    H --> I[Committed / Failed / Unknown]
    I --> R[Settlement Replay Receipt]
